  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating Viable Economic Units through Land Regularizati on and Titling</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tierra will test and improve an innovative methodology based upon community participation to give greater legal protection to interests in land and solve and reduce land disputes among farmers and rural communities while consolidating fragmented holdings into larger, more productive units in the central and northern altiplano minifundia sub- regions. The project will benefit some 3,000 families from 50 communities by enabling them to accelerate the steps leading to land title. (BO-506)</narrative>
  </description>
